Here's the **optimized `.env.example`** file:

```dotenv
# ============================================================
# Jungle World Resort API — Environment Variables Template
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values.
# NEVER commit the .env file to git.
# ============================================================

# ── Server ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
NODE_ENV=development
PORT=3000
API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# ── Frontend URLs (CORS whitelist) ──────────────────────────
FRONTEND_URL=http://localhost:5173
ADMIN_URL=http://localhost:5174

# ── Database (PostgreSQL / Supabase) ────────────────────────
# Use Supabase connection string from Project Settings → Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:password@host:5432/jungle_world

# ── JWT Auth ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generate secure keys with:
#   node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(48).toString('hex'))"
JWT_SECRET=your-secure-jwt-secret-48-chars-min
JWT_REFRESH_SECRET=your-secure-refresh-secret-48-chars-min
JWT_EXPIRE=7d
JWT_REFRESH_EXPIRE=30d

# ── Email — Gmail SMTP ──────────────────────────────────────
# Setup: See docs/GMAIL_SMTP_SETUP.md
SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_SECURE=false
SMTP_USER=your-gmail@gmail.com
SMTP_PASS=your-16-char-app-password
SMTP_FROM="Jungle World Resort" <your-gmail@gmail.com>

# ── Image Storage — Cloudinary ──────────────────────────────
# Signup at https://cloudinary.com (free: 25 GB storage)
# Get credentials from Dashboard
CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=your_cloud_name
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=your_api_key
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=your_api_secret

# ── Rate Limiting (Development) ──────────────────────────────
RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS=900000
RATE_LIMIT_MAX=100
RATE_LIMIT_MAX_DEV=5000
```

---

**What I removed (not implemented/not needed):**
- ❌ `DB_HOST, DB_PORT, DB_NAME, DB_USER, DB_PASSWORD` — use `DATABASE_URL`
- ❌ `SENDGRID_*` — replaced with simpler Gmail SMTP
- ❌ `GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID` — optional, not critical
- ❌ `TWILIO_*` — SMS not implemented
- ❌ `KHALTI_*`, `STRIPE_*` — payment systems not implemented
- ❌ `ADMIN_SECRET_KEY` — not used
- ❌ `LOG_LEVEL`, `ENCRYPTION_KEY` — not used
- ❌ `GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID`, `SENTRY_DSN` — not implemented
- ❌ `SUPABASE_*` — Cloudinary is primary storage

**Result:** Clean, production-ready `.env.example` with only essential configs. ✅